- U | write the cause as a fault in the old truck, and leave the speed out | mark: hid a wrong | closed: law: a report falsified; backfire: the inquiry tests the truck, finds nothing wrong with it, and takes the rank of whoever signed | takes_if_fails: rank | self_control: - | v: benevolence, security | tribal: tell the elders the raft's lashings failed, and leave the hurry out | magic: write the cause as a cracked axle, and leave the speed out | chance: 63
- B | write it straight, and make sure it shows who got the hurt soldier out | grants: mentioned in dispatches | v: achievement, power | tribal: tell it straight at the fire, and make sure the elders hear who carried the hurt hunter out | magic: write it straight, and make sure it shows who pulled the hurt soldier clear | chance: 67
- R | tell the friend to own up first, and stand beside them when they do | mark: helped someone in need | v: benevolence, universalism | chance: 70
- G | visit the hurt soldier every week until they are back on their feet | v: benevolence | tribal: sit with the hurt hunter every day until the arm is mended | magic: visit the hurt soldier at the healers' house every week until the arm mends | foot: person friend | chance: 64
- WUB | rewrite the drill so no driver that tired ever takes the wheel again | v: security, conformity | tribal: set a new rule for the guard, so nobody that tired ever takes the raft across again | magic: rewrite the standing orders, so no driver that tired ever takes the reins again | foot: lesson good drills keep people whole | chance: 75
- WRG | take a share of the blame, for not stopping a tired friend from driving | mark: owned up | v: benevolence, conformity | tribal: take a share of the blame, for not stopping a tired friend at the crossing | chance: 72
- WBR | write it true, and argue in it for the friend to be retrained, not punished | v: benevolence, power | tribal: tell it true at the fire, and ask the elders to teach the friend again, not cast them out | magic: write it true, and argue for the friend to be retrained, not broken | foot: door helped someone in need | chance: 66
- URG | go with the friend to the doctor about the sleepless nights first | v: benevolence, self-direction | tribal: take the friend to the healer about the sleepless nights first | magic: go with the friend to the healers' house about the sleepless nights first | foot: place care.houses | chance: 78
- UBG | ask the hurt soldier quietly what they want said, before writing a word | v: benevolence, security | tribal: ask the hurt hunter quietly what they want told, before the fire | foot: person colleague | chance: 84
works: The matter is closed, the arm mends, and {N} can look everyone in the unit in the eye.
works: A year on, the night is a story told to the newcomers, and things are done better because of it.
fails: The questions drag on for months, and the unit splits over who said what.
fails: It ends badly for {friend} anyway, and the friendship with it.

