- U>R | work out a scouting run over the far passes, and ask to lead it | title: army officer | requires: soldier | without: impossible | mark: learned a skill | v: self-direction, stimulation | chance: 35
- B>G | win the young hunters of your band over, and ask to lead them as its guard | title: army officer | requires: soldier | without: impossible | v: power, benevolence | chance: 35
